{"n":7,"file":"p07.mp3","duration":35.849998474121094,"text":"Pretty soon, the very old woman saw them coming. \"My dear!\" she cried, \"What are you doing? I asked for one little cat, and what do I see?\" Cats here, cats there, Cats and kittens everywhere, Hundreds of cats, Thousands of cats, Millions and billions and trillions of cats. \"But we can never feed them all,\" said the very old woman, \"They will eat us out of house and home.\"","lines":[{"i":0,"c":0,"len":48,"t":0.0,"t1":4.320000171661377},{"i":1,"c":49,"len":90,"t":5.21999979019165,"t1":13.899999618530273},{"i":2,"c":140,"len":22,"t":14.880000114440918,"t1":16.65999984741211},{"i":3,"c":163,"len":28,"t":17.5,"t1":19.200000762939453},{"i":4,"c":192,"len":17,"t":20.280000686645508,"t1":21.219999313354492},{"i":5,"c":210,"len":18,"t":22.219999313354492,"t1":23.18000030517578},{"i":6,"c":229,"len":44,"t":23.979999542236328,"t1":26.959999084472656},{"i":7,"c":274,"len":100,"t":27.559999465942383,"t1":34.7400016784668}],"words":[{"c":0,"t":0.0,"t1":0.44},{"c":7,"t":0.44,"t1":1.02},{"c":13,"t":1.38,"t1":1.64},{"c":17,"t":1.64,"t1":2.16},{"c":22,"t":2.16,"t1":2.76},{"c":26,"t":2.76,"t1":3.02},{"c":32,"t":3.02,"t1":3.52},{"c":36,"t":3.52,"t1":3.86},{"c":41,"t":3.86,"t1":4.32},{"c":50,"t":5.22,"t1":5.38},{"c":53,"t":5.38,"t1":5.96},{"c":60,"t":6.24,"t1":6.66},{"c":64,"t":6.66,"t1":7.02},{"c":72,"t":7.64,"t1":7.92},{"c":77,"t":7.92,"t1":8.08},{"c":81,"t":8.08,"t1":8.32},{"c":85,"t":8.32,"t1":8.68},{"c":92,"t":9.0,"t1":9.82},{"c":94,"t":9.82,"t1":10.24},{"c":100,"t":10.24,"t1":10.72},{"c":104,"t":10.72,"t1":11.08},{"c":108,"t":11.08,"t1":11.52},{"c":115,"t":11.52,"t1":11.9},{"c":120,"t":12.16,"t1":12.7},{"c":124,"t":12.7,"t1":13.04},{"c":129,"t":13.04,"t1":13.32},{"c":132,"t":13.32,"t1":13.6},{"c":134,"t":13.6,"t1":13.9},{"c":140,"t":14.88,"t1":14.88},{"c":145,"t":14.88,"t1":15.4},{"c":151,"t":16.06,"t1":16.08},{"c":156,"t":16.08,"t1":16.66},{"c":163,"t":17.5,"t1":17.5},{"c":168,"t":17.5,"t1":18.38},{"c":172,"t":